Leviathan is a Julia port of the Euler-characteristic-drop method of Vsevolod
Chestnov, Giulio Crisanti and Mathieu Giroux (arXiv:2606.29612). Portions of
src/ are translations of the authors' Mathematica code: landau_codes.m in
github.com/Giu989/Landau-s-Leviathans @ 47028b7 (Chestnov, Crisanti, Giroux)
and Kernel/euler_characteristic.m in github.com/Giu989/DiscKosky @ 5dca910
(Giulio Crisanti, Luke Lippstreu, Andrew J. McLeod, Maria Polackova). Those
repositories carry no license file. The copyright line above and the
permission below do not cover the translated portions, which NOTICE beside
this file lists by file and line.

